(
    title: "Frog Pond",
    developer: Some("Nick Turner"),
    description: Some("With careful timing, the player launches a frog up from the pond\'s edge to snap passing insects out of the air with its tongue — you can shuffle along the bank but never aim the tongue itself, so each fly\'s darting flight path has to be read and anticipated. The aim is simply to catch as many as you can, a near-twin of Frogs and Flies."),
